# The ledger and its per-day reports moved OUT of this repository, to
# ~/.claude/measurement/. These patterns stay as a backstop: that tooling can be
# pointed at a checkout by mistake, and a tracked ledger would then block every
# promotion that touched it.
docs/measurement-ledger.tsv
docs/measurement-daily-by-project.md
docs/measurement-daily-by-role.md
docs/measurement-daily-by-kind.md
docs/measurement-daily-by-model.md
# Real project keys: local only, and the one file that must never be committed —
# a list of client names in a public repository publishes what it is there to hide
docs/project-nicknames.tsv
.codeql/
